# =============================================================================
# abdm-adapter-svc — configuration lives at the repo root
# =============================================================================
# This service loads (in order, later wins):
#   <repo>/.env → <repo>/.env.local → services/abdm-adapter-svc/.env (deprecated)
#   → services/abdm-adapter-svc/.env.local
#
# See `src/workspace-env.ts`. Full variable list: repo root `.env.example`
# (section "ABDM adapter").
#
# Migration (teams with an old service-local .env):
#   1. Copy ABDM_SANDBOX_* , DATABASE_URL / ABDM_DATA_DATABASE_URL , and any
#      optional keys into repo root `.env` or `.env.local`.
#   2. Delete or stop maintaining `services/abdm-adapter-svc/.env`.
#   3. Restart: `npx nx run abdm-adapter-svc:serve` or `make dev`.
#
# Quick start (new dev):
#   cp .env.example .env          # at repo root, not here
#   make setup                    # includes abdm-adapter-svc:db-migrate
#   make dev
#
# Swagger: http://localhost:3007/docs
# Migrate:  npx nx run abdm-adapter-svc:db-migrate
